      "expected_delta_mean_db": 6.4,
      "expected_delta_std_db": 1.0,
      "prompt": "Using Sionna's built-in box-with-two-screens indoor testbed, place a base-station transmitter at (0, 0, 4.5) m with 100 mW transmit power and isotropic antenna arrays. Generate the 5 GHz coverage map, then re-tune the transmitter to 2.4 GHz and generate that coverage map. Return both maps and the per-cell delta.",
